{"id":2101,"name":"辣椒炒肉","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2101.jpg","category":"荤菜","taste":"香辣","cookingMethod":"炒制","difficulty":"普通","cookingTime":"25分钟","servings":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1 个人食用","ingredients":["猪瘦肉","青椒","蒜","姜","豆豉（可选）","食用油","盐","生抽","蚝油"],"preparation":["猪瘦肉 200g","青椒或螺丝椒 250g","蒜 3瓣（约12g）","姜 5g","豆豉 5g（可选）","食用油 15ml","盐 3g","生抽 5ml","蚝油 5g"],"steps":["青椒去蒂后斜切片；蒜切片，姜切末。","猪肉逆着纹理切薄片，加入生抽、蚝油和 1g 盐抓匀，冷藏腌制 10 分钟。","炒锅烧热，不放油，放入青椒和 1g 盐，中火干煸 2-3 分钟，至表面出现焦斑后盛出。","锅中倒入食用油，放入蒜、姜和豆豉炒香。","加入肉片，中大火迅速炒散，直至肉片完全变色且中心熟透。","放回青椒，加入剩余盐，大火翻炒约 1 分钟即可。"],"nutrition":{"calories":"425 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E8%BE%A3%E6%A4%92%E7%82%92%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E8%BE%A3%E6%A4%92%E7%82%92%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/meat_dish/%E8%BE%A3%E6%A4%92%E7%82%92%E8%82%89.md","imageSource":{"author":"CHENG SHIYI","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chinese%20food%20in%20Hunan.jpg"}}}
